version: 3
name: ArenaProjectileVisualBehavior
id_counter: 25
description: Begin chooses a random orientation and spin from editable vector ranges. GameVisualMotion integrates the spin while the projectile is alive, and its emitter leaves the path trail.
owner_type: ecs.entity
graphs:
- kind: event
